    "sections": {
        "description": "Legacy Preschool Kindergarten is a multipurpose theme designed for early education websites such as preschools, kindergartens, daycare centers, and child-focused learning programs. The theme features a clean and minimal layout with a responsive design that adapts to desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes sections commonly used on educational websites, such as a banner area, testimonial section, staff/team showcase, and call-to-action buttons. Social media integration is available, and the theme is translation-ready for multilingual use.Developers and site owners can customize layouts, colors, and content using built-in options and shortcodes. The theme uses Bootstrap for a structured framework and optimized code for stable performance. Retina-ready support ensures images display clearly on high-resolution screens, and selective animations provide subtle interaction effects without cluttering the interface.This theme is suitable for educational websites seeking a structured, adaptable, and accessible design."
    },
